	(text "T1701 pin/polarity and four center taps audited to Pulse page 2.\nPHY CTs: one 100nF to GND each, following RTL8125BG reference.\nCable CTs feed active PoE bridge; 10nF series caps block PoE DC\nin Bob-Smith termination. CHASSIS is RJ45 shell/enclosure only.\nNo copper connection across magnetics or to primary PoE returns.\nExact transformer and RJ45 footprints remain a layout gate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
